     CHANGED (Phase 12):
       MS Access frmMaintWGStaff DataGrid converted to Razor view bound to MaintWGStaffViewModel.
       Breadcrumb, title, side-nav, and grid container replicated from HTML prototype.
       DataGrid AJAX reload, Add/Edit/Delete JS functions, save payload builder added.

     CHANGED (Phase 14 — Security fix 2026-06-11):
       FIXED XSS — JavaScript context injection:
         var wgStaffGridId = '@Model.WGStaffGrid.GridId'  →
         var wgStaffGridId = '@System.Text.Encodings.Web.JavaScriptEncoder.Default.Encode(Model.WGStaffGrid.GridId)';
         Model.WGStaffGrid.GridId is a server-controlled string but all model-sourced values
         emitted into a JS string literal MUST be JavaScript-encoded (not just HTML-encoded)
         to prevent XSS if the value ever contains quotes, backslashes, or control characters.
         JavaScriptEncoder.Default.Encode() applies the correct encoding for the JavaScript context.

     PRESERVED: govuk-breadcrumbs structure, h1 "Work Group Staff", wgg-layout-row side-nav pattern.
                All CRUD JS functions (addMaintWGStaff, editMaintWGStaff, deleteMaintWGStaff,
                saveMaintWGStaff, closeModal, isFormValid) preserved verbatim.

     DEFERRED / REQUIRES HUMAN REVIEW:
       TRANSFORMENGINE TODO: _MaintenanceSideNav "MaintWGStaff" — confirm this nav key is registered
         in _sidenav-maintenanceMenu-config equivalent for the MVC app.
       TRANSFORMENGINE TODO: saveMaintWGStaff() builds WorkGroupEmployeeDto field names (Name,
         WorkGroupGrade, MakeAvailable as int, TimeRecorder as int) from WorkGroupEmployeeItem
         input IDs. Verify FpsViewModelMapper ForMember overrides for Name<->StaffName,
         WorkGroupGrade<->WgGrade, and int<->bool conversions are applied before running.
       TRANSFORMENGINE TODO: wgGrade passed as string.Empty to backend — confirm backend treats
         empty wgGrade as "return all grades". See MaintWGStaffController for full DEFERRED note.
       TRANSFORMENGINE TODO: showGovukAlert() — verify implementation uses .text() (safe) not .html()
         (XSS risk) when rendering server-supplied response.message in deleteMaintWGStaff and
